  "account": "林睿读书&书在橱窗",
  "source_title": "北京香山红叶，张家界秋山云海，庐山云雾红叶，黄山奇松怪石，南京栖霞山古寺红枫。香山只排第十，黄山挤不进前五#中国十大秋日胜地 #秋日旅行 #赏秋好去处 #秋天去哪儿 #中国秋天",
  "title_is_metadata_not_transcript": true,
  "input_mode": "text_only",
  "status": "AI_PENDING",
  "unit_index": 1,
  "unit_count": 1,
  "all_video_unit_ids": [
    "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 396.573991,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "您知道中国秋天最值得专程跑一趟的圣地是哪一处吗？有人说四川九寨沟秋天水色天下第一，有人说北京香山红叶名气大的没边，对不住了，九寨沟排不进前五，香山也只能垫底。香正排第一的那一处不在名山大川，也不在古都名城，一年就那么短短几十天，整座大山从山顶到山脚，自己换上一身颜色。今天咱们就来盘点中国十大秋日名山。话不多说，茶给您沏上了，劳烦您顺手点个小红心，咱们这就开讲。第十名。北京香山京西名山香山红叶是京城秋天的金字招牌。全园采叶树种有黄痤、元宝峰、银杏等，红叶节期间累计接待游客超过八十五万人次。黄格赤是主力军，漫山遍野红的像火焰一样，跟碧云寺、香山寺这些古建筑搭在一起，别处找不到这个味儿，可您知道吗？一到红叶节，香炉峰上，全是人脑袋拍照的，举着手机，等半天才轮得上。您说看红叶到底是看树还是看人呢？能排进前十，靠的是老底子和京城的那股子气派。第九名，湖南张家界、湘西武陵源。很多人一提张家界脑子里就是那些石头柱子，可秋天的张家界完全是另一副面孔。每年九月到十一月，天子山一带，云雾缭绕，石英沙岩。风林在云海里若隐若现，金黄的银杏和火红的枫叶，跟灰白色的石头风铃搅在一起。雨后初晴的清晨，云海沿山谷漫涌过来，一座座石柱忽明武汉，时而露出全身，时而缩进云里。您站在天子阁上往下望，脚底下是云云，里头是风风，上面是秋叶三千座奇峰泡在云海里。您说这样的地方是不是老天爷喝醉了，画出来第八名，江西庐山、九江名山庐山的秋天跟别处不一样，他是有文人气质的。李白写过飞流直下三千尺，可秋天来庐山。您看的不是瀑布，是雾。深秋一到，如琴湖畔的洪峰倒映在水面上，梧桐叶黄了，鸡爪红了，山雾随风飘过来，半遮半掩彩色的秋景，一会儿看得见，一会儿看不见，倒映在湖里，跟做梦似最佳赏秋期。是十月下旬到十一月上旬，高海拔的红叶鲜红，低处的银杏接棒能一直美。到十二月初，您沿着锦绣谷慢慢走，雾来了就歇歇脚，误走了，就接着看一座山，能让您一天里看到三种不同的秋色。您说这是不是把秋天过程的事第七名？安徽黄山，皖南名山黄山的秋天是云海和高山松的搭配。深秋一到，洪枫，乌折银杏点缀在奇松怪石之间，晴天多，湿度低，撞见云海日出的机会特别大。最佳观赏期是十月下旬到十一月上旬。这段时间，彩铃和云海一起上，您在光明顶等日出，脚底下云海翻腾，远处的山峰从云里冒出来，近处的松树枝上挂着秋叶，您站在鳌鱼峰上看西海大峡谷，整条峡谷从浅黄到火红一层一层往底下铺。松树还是绿的，夹在中间，像有人拿刀刻出来的一座山，把云海齐松、秋叶三样东西攒在一块儿，您说值不值得爬那一千多级台阶。第六名，江苏南京栖霞山、金陵名山栖霞山被叫做金陵最美的一座山。每年十一月中旬到十二月初。红叶覆盖率超过百分之八十。栖霞古寺是南朝四百八十寺里留下来的红墙黑瓦，配上满天红叶蝉，意浓的化不开。您从西门进去，先过栖霞寺，再往桃花湖走，先边鸡爪红的发亮。石面上飘着一层红叶，石阶上飘着一厚一层，踩上去咔咔响。中山陵那边的梧桐也黄了，一条陵园，路两侧全是金色，南京的秋天短的很，就那么二十来天。一座山把六朝古都的秋天浓缩在一条山沟里，您说这是不是老天爷对南京的偏爱？从第十道第六名，香山靠的是京城老底子。张家界的奇峰泡在云海里，庐山用雾和红叶搭出了石意。黄山把云海和彩林攒在一块儿，栖霞山拿古饰配红墙，可他们还不是最值得专程跑一趟的。接下来第五道第一名更厉害。有一座古村，把梯田和银杏画成了油画，有一片贪涂在秋天，变成光影的海洋，可排在榜首的那一处。整座火山天池泡在金黄色的林海里，他是哪里？他凭什么排在九寨沟前面下一集已经同步更新了，点开我的头像，进主页就能看到点个关注，看看谁才是中国秋日胜地真正的天花板。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00001",
      "start_ms": 130,
      "end_ms": 6090,
      "text": "您知道中国秋天最值得专程跑一趟的圣地是哪一处吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00002",
      "start_ms": 7090,
      "end_ms": 11590,
      "text": "有人说四川九寨沟秋天水色天下第一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00003",
      "start_ms": 12190,
      "end_ms": 16309,
      "text": "有人说北京香山红叶名气大的没边，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00004",
      "start_ms": 16790,
      "end_ms": 17570,
      "text": "对不住了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00005",
      "start_ms": 18550,
      "end_ms": 20390,
      "text": "九寨沟排不进前五，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00006",
      "start_ms": 20910,
      "end_ms": 22650,
      "text": "香山也只能垫底。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00007",
      "start_ms": 23430,
      "end_ms": 27150,
      "text": "香正排第一的那一处不在名山大川，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00008",
      "start_ms": 27790,
      "end_ms": 29605,
      "text": "也不在古都名城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00009",
      "start_ms": 30470,
      "end_ms": 32810,
      "text": "一年就那么短短几十天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00010",
      "start_ms": 33310,
      "end_ms": 36230,
      "text": "整座大山从山顶到山脚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00011",
      "start_ms": 36390,
      "end_ms": 38010,
      "text": "自己换上一身颜色。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00012",
      "start_ms": 38670,
      "end_ms": 43410,
      "text": "今天咱们就来盘点中国十大秋日名山。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00013",
      "start_ms": 43490,
      "end_ms": 44250,
      "text": "话不多说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00014",
      "start_ms": 44510,
      "end_ms": 45670,
      "text": "茶给您沏上了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00015",
      "start_ms": 45990,
      "end_ms": 48130,
      "text": "劳烦您顺手点个小红心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00016",
      "start_ms": 48370,
      "end_ms": 49390,
      "text": "咱们这就开讲。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00017",
      "start_ms": 50550,
      "end_ms": 51250,
      "text": "第十名。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00018",
      "start_ms": 52110,
      "end_ms": 58970,
      "text": "北京香山京西名山香山红叶是京城秋天的金字招牌。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00019",
      "start_ms": 59350,
      "end_ms": 64045,
      "text": "全园采叶树种有黄痤、元宝峰、银杏等，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00020",
      "start_ms": 64580,
      "end_ms": 68985,
      "text": "红叶节期间累计接待游客超过八十五万人次。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00021",
      "start_ms": 69480,
      "end_ms": 71155,
      "text": "黄格赤是主力军，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00022",
      "start_ms": 71750,
      "end_ms": 74595,
      "text": "漫山遍野红的像火焰一样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00023",
      "start_ms": 75030,
      "end_ms": 79095,
      "text": "跟碧云寺、香山寺这些古建筑搭在一起，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00024",
      "start_ms": 79670,
      "end_ms": 81275,
      "text": "别处找不到这个味儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00025",
      "start_ms": 81800,
      "end_ms": 82580,
      "text": "可您知道吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00026",
      "start_ms": 82580,
      "end_ms": 83615,
      "text": "一到红叶节，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00027",
      "start_ms": 84050,
      "end_ms": 84870,
      "text": "香炉峰上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00028",
      "start_ms": 84890,
      "end_ms": 86900,
      "text": "全是人脑袋拍照的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00029",
      "start_ms": 86900,
      "end_ms": 87540,
      "text": "举着手机，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00030",
      "start_ms": 87540,
      "end_ms": 88905,
      "text": "等半天才轮得上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00031",
      "start_ms": 89350,
      "end_ms": 92195,
      "text": "您说看红叶到底是看树还是看人呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00032",
      "start_ms": 92540,
      "end_ms": 93845,
      "text": "能排进前十，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00033",
      "start_ms": 94400,
      "end_ms": 98115,
      "text": "靠的是老底子和京城的那股子气派。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00034",
      "start_ms": 98660,
      "end_ms": 99325,
      "text": "第九名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00035",
      "start_ms": 99670,
      "end_ms": 102205,
      "text": "湖南张家界、湘西武陵源。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00036",
      "start_ms": 102770,
      "end_ms": 106535,
      "text": "很多人一提张家界脑子里就是那些石头柱子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00037",
      "start_ms": 107200,
      "end_ms": 110255,
      "text": "可秋天的张家界完全是另一副面孔。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00038",
      "start_ms": 111130,
      "end_ms": 113335,
      "text": "每年九月到十一月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00039",
      "start_ms": 113870,
      "end_ms": 114870,
      "text": "天子山一带，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00040",
      "start_ms": 114950,
      "end_ms": 115965,
      "text": "云雾缭绕，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00041",
      "start_ms": 116550,
      "end_ms": 117550,
      "text": "石英沙岩。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00042",
      "start_ms": 117570,
      "end_ms": 120500,
      "text": "风林在云海里若隐若现，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00043",
      "start_ms": 120640,
      "end_ms": 123745,
      "text": "金黄的银杏和火红的枫叶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00044",
      "start_ms": 124070,
      "end_ms": 126755,
      "text": "跟灰白色的石头风铃搅在一起。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00045",
      "start_ms": 127730,
      "end_ms": 129255,
      "text": "雨后初晴的清晨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00046",
      "start_ms": 129790,
      "end_ms": 132235,
      "text": "云海沿山谷漫涌过来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00047",
      "start_ms": 133090,
      "end_ms": 135510,
      "text": "一座座石柱忽明武汉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00048",
      "start_ms": 136000,
      "end_ms": 137255,
      "text": "时而露出全身，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00049",
      "start_ms": 137580,
      "end_ms": 138695,
      "text": "时而缩进云里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00050",
      "start_ms": 139800,
      "end_ms": 141555,
      "text": "您站在天子阁上往下望，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00051",
      "start_ms": 142400,
      "end_ms": 144690,
      "text": "脚底下是云云，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00052",
      "start_ms": 144690,
      "end_ms": 146470,
      "text": "里头是风风，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00053",
      "start_ms": 146510,
      "end_ms": 151175,
      "text": "上面是秋叶三千座奇峰泡在云海里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00054",
      "start_ms": 151710,
      "end_ms": 154170,
      "text": "您说这样的地方是不是老天爷喝醉了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00055",
      "start_ms": 154170,
      "end_ms": 156545,
      "text": "画出来第八名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00056",
      "start_ms": 157480,
      "end_ms": 163730,
      "text": "江西庐山、九江名山庐山的秋天跟别处不一样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00057",
      "start_ms": 163750,
      "end_ms": 165485,
      "text": "他是有文人气质的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00058",
      "start_ms": 165900,
      "end_ms": 168225,
      "text": "李白写过飞流直下三千尺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00059",
      "start_ms": 168840,
      "end_ms": 170185,
      "text": "可秋天来庐山。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00060",
      "start_ms": 170500,
      "end_ms": 171700,
      "text": "您看的不是瀑布，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00061",
      "start_ms": 171880,
      "end_ms": 172485,
      "text": "是雾。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00062",
      "start_ms": 173170,
      "end_ms": 174135,
      "text": "深秋一到，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00063",
      "start_ms": 174530,
      "end_ms": 177815,
      "text": "如琴湖畔的洪峰倒映在水面上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00064",
      "start_ms": 178270,
      "end_ms": 179515,
      "text": "梧桐叶黄了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00065",
      "start_ms": 179830,
      "end_ms": 180775,
      "text": "鸡爪红了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00066",
      "start_ms": 181090,
      "end_ms": 182650,
      "text": "山雾随风飘过来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00067",
      "start_ms": 182750,
      "end_ms": 185780,
      "text": "半遮半掩彩色的秋景，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00068",
      "start_ms": 185780,
      "end_ms": 186680,
      "text": "一会儿看得见，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00069",
      "start_ms": 186680,
      "end_ms": 187605,
      "text": "一会儿看不见，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00070",
      "start_ms": 187920,
      "end_ms": 188880,
      "text": "倒映在湖里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00071",
      "start_ms": 188880,
      "end_ms": 191860,
      "text": "跟做梦似最佳赏秋期。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00072",
      "start_ms": 192060,
      "end_ms": 194825,
      "text": "是十月下旬到十一月上旬，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00073",
      "start_ms": 195340,
      "end_ms": 197375,
      "text": "高海拔的红叶鲜红，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00074",
      "start_ms": 197880,
      "end_ms": 201010,
      "text": "低处的银杏接棒能一直美。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00075",
      "start_ms": 201010,
      "end_ms": 202190,
      "text": "到十二月初，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00076",
      "start_ms": 202390,
      "end_ms": 204605,
      "text": "您沿着锦绣谷慢慢走，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00077",
      "start_ms": 204980,
      "end_ms": 206405,
      "text": "雾来了就歇歇脚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00078",
      "start_ms": 206800,
      "end_ms": 207500,
      "text": "误走了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00079",
      "start_ms": 207500,
      "end_ms": 209470,
      "text": "就接着看一座山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00080",
      "start_ms": 209730,
      "end_ms": 213305,
      "text": "能让您一天里看到三种不同的秋色。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00081",
      "start_ms": 213800,
      "end_ms": 218045,
      "text": "您说这是不是把秋天过程的事第七名？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00082",
      "start_ms": 219190,
      "end_ms": 220115,
      "text": "安徽黄山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00083",
      "start_ms": 220460,
      "end_ms": 226115,
      "text": "皖南名山黄山的秋天是云海和高山松的搭配。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00084",
      "start_ms": 226600,
      "end_ms": 227455,
      "text": "深秋一到，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00085",
      "start_ms": 228160,
      "end_ms": 228660,
      "text": "洪枫，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00086",
      "start_ms": 229000,
      "end_ms": 232945,
      "text": "乌折银杏点缀在奇松怪石之间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00087",
      "start_ms": 233210,
      "end_ms": 233930,
      "text": "晴天多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00088",
      "start_ms": 234410,
      "end_ms": 235235,
      "text": "湿度低，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00089",
      "start_ms": 235690,
      "end_ms": 238235,
      "text": "撞见云海日出的机会特别大。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00090",
      "start_ms": 238910,
      "end_ms": 243520,
      "text": "最佳观赏期是十月下旬到十一月上旬。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00091",
      "start_ms": 243660,
      "end_ms": 244440,
      "text": "这段时间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00092",
      "start_ms": 244440,
      "end_ms": 246355,
      "text": "彩铃和云海一起上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00093",
      "start_ms": 246770,
      "end_ms": 248735,
      "text": "您在光明顶等日出，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00094",
      "start_ms": 249190,
      "end_ms": 251005,
      "text": "脚底下云海翻腾，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00095",
      "start_ms": 251690,
      "end_ms": 254685,
      "text": "远处的山峰从云里冒出来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00096",
      "start_ms": 255080,
      "end_ms": 257805,
      "text": "近处的松树枝上挂着秋叶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00097",
      "start_ms": 258490,
      "end_ms": 261895,
      "text": "您站在鳌鱼峰上看西海大峡谷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00098",
      "start_ms": 262720,
      "end_ms": 267415,
      "text": "整条峡谷从浅黄到火红一层一层往底下铺。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00099",
      "start_ms": 268190,
      "end_ms": 269775,
      "text": "松树还是绿的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00100",
      "start_ms": 270690,
      "end_ms": 271470,
      "text": "夹在中间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00101",
      "start_ms": 271590,
      "end_ms": 274410,
      "text": "像有人拿刀刻出来的一座山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00102",
      "start_ms": 274470,
      "end_ms": 279735,
      "text": "把云海齐松、秋叶三样东西攒在一块儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00103",
      "start_ms": 280370,
      "end_ms": 283330,
      "text": "您说值不值得爬那一千多级台阶。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00104",
      "start_ms": 283450,
      "end_ms": 284030,
      "text": "第六名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00105",
      "start_ms": 284110,
      "end_ms": 290535,
      "text": "江苏南京栖霞山、金陵名山栖霞山被叫做金陵最美的一座山。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00106",
      "start_ms": 291130,
      "end_ms": 293905,
      "text": "每年十一月中旬到十二月初。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00107",
      "start_ms": 294590,
      "end_ms": 297350,
      "text": "红叶覆盖率超过百分之八十。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00108",
      "start_ms": 298010,
      "end_ms": 303510,
      "text": "栖霞古寺是南朝四百八十寺里留下来的红墙黑瓦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00109",
      "start_ms": 303550,
      "end_ms": 305950,
      "text": "配上满天红叶蝉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00110",
      "start_ms": 306030,
      "end_ms": 307410,
      "text": "意浓的化不开。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00111",
      "start_ms": 307830,
      "end_ms": 309190,
      "text": "您从西门进去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00112",
      "start_ms": 309590,
      "end_ms": 310990,
      "text": "先过栖霞寺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00113",
      "start_ms": 311390,
      "end_ms": 312910,
      "text": "再往桃花湖走，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00114",
      "start_ms": 313390,
      "end_ms": 315310,
      "text": "先边鸡爪红的发亮。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00115",
      "start_ms": 315950,
      "end_ms": 318410,
      "text": "石面上飘着一层红叶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00116",
      "start_ms": 318930,
      "end_ms": 321530,
      "text": "石阶上飘着一厚一层，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00117",
      "start_ms": 322090,
      "end_ms": 323835,
      "text": "踩上去咔咔响。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00118",
      "start_ms": 324750,
      "end_ms": 327550,
      "text": "中山陵那边的梧桐也黄了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00119",
      "start_ms": 327570,
      "end_ms": 328330,
      "text": "一条陵园，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00120",
      "start_ms": 328330,
      "end_ms": 330070,
      "text": "路两侧全是金色，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00121",
      "start_ms": 330730,
      "end_ms": 332410,
      "text": "南京的秋天短的很，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00122",
      "start_ms": 332530,
      "end_ms": 333650,
      "text": "就那么二十来天。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00123",
      "start_ms": 334550,
      "end_ms": 338690,
      "text": "一座山把六朝古都的秋天浓缩在一条山沟里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00124",
      "start_ms": 339390,
      "end_ms": 342510,
      "text": "您说这是不是老天爷对南京的偏爱？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00125",
      "start_ms": 343070,
      "end_ms": 344490,
      "text": "从第十道第六名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00126",
      "start_ms": 344970,
      "end_ms": 347290,
      "text": "香山靠的是京城老底子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00127",
      "start_ms": 347810,
      "end_ms": 350410,
      "text": "张家界的奇峰泡在云海里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00128",
      "start_ms": 350870,
      "end_ms": 354155,
      "text": "庐山用雾和红叶搭出了石意。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00129",
      "start_ms": 354980,
      "end_ms": 358015,
      "text": "黄山把云海和彩林攒在一块儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00130",
      "start_ms": 358380,
      "end_ms": 360725,
      "text": "栖霞山拿古饰配红墙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00131",
      "start_ms": 361200,
      "end_ms": 363920,
      "text": "可他们还不是最值得专程跑一趟的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00132",
      "start_ms": 363980,
      "end_ms": 366205,
      "text": "接下来第五道第一名更厉害。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00133",
      "start_ms": 366710,
      "end_ms": 367715,
      "text": "有一座古村，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00134",
      "start_ms": 368010,
      "end_ms": 370835,
      "text": "把梯田和银杏画成了油画，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00135",
      "start_ms": 371260,
      "end_ms": 372960,
      "text": "有一片贪涂在秋天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00136",
      "start_ms": 372960,
      "end_ms": 374625,
      "text": "变成光影的海洋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00137",
      "start_ms": 375010,
      "end_ms": 377185,
      "text": "可排在榜首的那一处。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00138",
      "start_ms": 377740,
      "end_ms": 381145,
      "text": "整座火山天池泡在金黄色的林海里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00139",
      "start_ms": 381480,
      "end_ms": 382085,
      "text": "他是哪里？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00140",
      "start_ms": 382400,
      "end_ms": 387185,
      "text": "他凭什么排在九寨沟前面下一集已经同步更新了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00141",
      "start_ms": 387570,
      "end_ms": 388670,
      "text": "点开我的头像，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00142",
      "start_ms": 388830,
      "end_ms": 391980,
      "text": "进主页就能看到点个关注，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_4fef7d308fa53d59_s00143",
      "start_ms": 392080,
      "end_ms": 396445,
      "text": "看看谁才是中国秋日胜地真正的天花板。"
    }
  ],
